            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for mowing a plurality of lawns (102a,b..) using two or more robotic lawn mowers (101a,b.., 101'a,b..,201a,b..) which each has a rechargeable energy storage. The method comprises the steps of delivering at least one of the mowers (101a,b..,201a,b..), typically one or two, to each lawn (102a,b..) to be mowed and starting the said at least one mower when placed on a lawn, allowing the mowers (101a,b..,201a,b..) to mow the lawns (102a,b..) on which they have been placed; and fetching the mowers (101a,b..,201a,b..) after they have finalized the mowing of the lawns (102a,b..) on which they were placed in the first step.</p>
            </abstract>
